OL,3,CAnn Widdecombe: Family, friends and
OL,4,Ccolleagues attend funeral of former MP
OL,6,FA funeral service has taken place for
OL,7,Fthe former Conservative minister and
OL,8,FReform UK spokesperson Ann Widdecombe.
OL,10,FFamily, friends, and colleagues
OL,11,Fgathered at Buckfast Abbey in Devon, a
OL,12,FCatholic abbey where she regularly
OL,13,Fworshipped and called her "safe haven".
OL,15,FMiss Widdecombe, 78, was found dead in
OL,16,Fher home in Haytor on Dartmoor, with
OL,17,Fserious head injuries on 8 July.
OL,19,FJoshua Kerry, 28, of Rotherham, South
OL,20,FYorkshire, was charged with her murder
OL,21,Fon 20 July.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
