OL,3,CAnn Widdecombe: Family, friends and
OL,4,Ccolleagues attend funeral of former MP
OL,6,FIt is understood that Reform's leader
OL,7,FNigel Farage did not attend the event.
OL,8,FMr Farage was campaigning in Clacton
OL,9,Fon Wednesday and did not wish to draw
OL,10,Fattention to Miss Widdecombe's
OL,11,Ffuneral, which the family asked to be
OL,12,Fkept private.
OL,14,FHowever, he is expected to attend a
OL,15,Fpublic memorial for Miss Widdecombe,
OL,16,Fwhich will be held later this year.
OL,18,FIn a post on X, Mr Farage described
OL,19,Fher as an "extraordinary woman who
OL,20,Fleft a serious mark on British
OL,21,Fpolitics".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
