OL,3,CAnn Widdecombe: Family, friends and
OL,4,Ccolleagues attend funeral of former MP
OL,6,FSir Mel Stride, who is the local MP
OL,7,Ffor the abbey and attended the
OL,8,Fservice, described the funeral as
OL,9,F"very moving" in a post on X.
OL,11,FThe Central Devon MP said: "The sun
OL,12,Fshone bright for her. A very special
OL,13,Flady who will be much missed."
