OL,3,CAnn Widdecombe: Family, friends and
OL,4,Ccolleagues attend funeral of former MP
OL,6,FAn earlier statement from the abbey
OL,7,Fsaid Miss Widdecombe would be "missed
OL,8,Fand fondly remembered", and "many in
OL,9,Four worshipping community knew her as
OL,10,Fa kind and warm character".
OL,12,FIt added: "Ann was a woman of profound
OL,13,Ffaith, a faith which found expression
OL,14,Fin the public forum of politics.
OL,16,F"Ann was unafraid to express her
OL,17,Funwavering convictions, formed through
OL,18,Fher Roman Catholic faith. She had a
OL,19,Fsharp intellect and was a dedicated
OL,20,Fpublic servant."
